sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant QS as Query Service
    participant Cache as Semantic Cache
    participant VDB as Vector DB
    participant ES as Elasticsearch
    participant Rerank as Reranker
    participant PB as Prompt Builder
    participant LLM as LLM Gateway
    participant PG as PostgreSQL

    User->>GW: POST /api/v1/query
    GW->>GW: Auth + rate limit
    GW->>QS: Forward request

    QS->>Cache: Semantic similarity search
    alt Cache Hit (cosine > 0.95)
        Cache-->>QS: Cached answer + sources
        QS-->>User: Stream cached response
    else Cache Miss
        par Vector Search
            QS->>VDB: Embed query → cosine search (top 20)
        and Keyword Search
            QS->>ES: BM25 search (top 20)
        end

        VDB-->>QS: Semantic results
        ES-->>QS: Keyword results

        QS->>QS: Reciprocal Rank Fusion → top 30
        QS->>Rerank: Cross-encoder rerank
        Rerank-->>QS: Top 5 chunks
        QS->>QS: Access control filter

        QS->>PB: Build prompt
        PB->>LLM: Stream generation request

        loop Token by token
            LLM-->>QS: Token
            QS-->>User: SSE chunk
        end

        QS-->>User: SSE done + sources
        QS->>Cache: Cache result
        QS->>PG: Log query + response
    end
